  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Tag Input",
    "Description",
    "A field for entering multiple values as removable chips (tokens) — recipients, labels, keywords. Type and confirm to add; remove via the chip or backspace. For a single free value use Text Input.",
    "Usage",
    "Confirm a token on Enter or comma. Show chips inline; allow removal via the chip or backspace. Optionally suggest matches, like Autocomplete.",
    "States",
    "Default · Hover · Focus · Filled · Adding\nDisabled / Read-only — chips shown, not editable.\nError — invalid token; message + aria-invalid.",
    "Sizes",
    "sm (36px)   Dense forms.\nmd (44px)   Default. Meets the 44px touch target.",
    "Accessibility",
    "Labelled field; each chip’s remove is a labelled button. Announce added/removed tokens. Backspace removes the last chip; keyboard reaches every chip.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Confirm tokens on Enter / comma\nDO   Make each chip removable\nDO   Announce add / remove\nDO   Validate tokens with a message",
    "DON'T   Use for a single value (use Text Input)\nDON'T   Trap focus among chips\nDON'T   Rely on colour alone for errors\nDON'T   Lose typed text on blur"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
